  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_01",
      "hash64": "202010556D6F7C6C",
      "text": "Ma... è assurdo...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_02",
      "hash64": "202013556D6F8185",
      "text": "Povero Ogerpon... Altro che beniamici! Quei tre\\nsono il peggio del peggio![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_03",
      "hash64": "202012556D6F7FD2",
      "text": "È tutto il contrario di quello che raccontano!\\nDevono saperlo tutti![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "A90088882A053D61",
      "text": "Calmati! Che ti ho appena detto?! Non bisogna\\nparlarne con nessuno![VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_04",
      "hash64": "20200D556D6F7753",
      "text": "Ma...![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_05",
      "hash64": "A9008C882A05442D",
      "text": "Gli abitanti del paese credono ciecamente\\nalla versione della storia che conoscono.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_06",
      "hash64": "A90089882A053F14",
      "text": "Come pensi che reagirebbero se qualcuno desse\\ndegli impostori ai beniamici che adorano?[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_05",
      "hash64": "20200C556D6F75A0",
      "text": "Non la prenderebbero per niente bene, mi sa...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_07",
      "hash64": "A9008A882A0540C7",
      "text": "Proprio così...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_08",
      "hash64": "A9007F882A052E16",
      "text": "Ai tempi anche il nostro antenato, il mascheraio,\\nce la mise tutta per diffondere la verità...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_09",
      "hash64": "A90080882A052FC9",
      "text": "Ma nessuno lo ascoltò. Anzi, lo perseguitarono\\ndandogli del miscredente.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_06",
      "hash64": "20200F556D6F7AB9",
      "text": "Mi fa andare in bestia ancora di più![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_10",
      "hash64": "A9040D882A085537",
      "text": "Per proteggere i propri discendenti, il nostro\\nantenato decise di tacere...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_11",
      "hash64": "A9040C882A085384",
      "text": "E di tramandare la verità in segreto.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_07",
      "hash64": "20200E556D6F7906",
      "text": "Capito...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_08",
      "hash64": "202019556D6F8BB7",
      "text": "E Rirì? Non è che la conosce già questa storia?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_12",
      "hash64": "A9040F882A08589D",
      "text": "Riben? No, non credo. Non gliel’ho ancora\\nraccontata... Perché?[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_09",
      "hash64": "202018556D6F8A04",
      "text": "Niente... Sai, siccome ha questa passione\\nsmisurata per l’orco...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_10",
      "hash64": "201C8B556D6C6496",
      "text": "Ogni tanto si dà certe arie, come se conoscesse\\nOgerpon di persona.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_13",
      "hash64": "A9040E882A0856EA",
      "text": "Non saprei... È un ragazzino sensibile. Non mi\\nstupirebbe se si fosse accorto di qualcosa.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_14",
      "hash64": "A90409882A084E6B",
      "text": "Racconterò la verità anche a lui quando verrà\\nil momento.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_15",
      "hash64": "A90408882A084CB8",
      "text": "Voi non parlatene con nessuno, mi raccomando.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_11",
      "hash64": "201C8C556D6C6649",
      "text": "Capito, capito...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_12",
      "hash64": "201C89556D6C6130",
      "text": "Ci mancavano solo altri segreti da mantenere...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_16",
      "hash64": "A9040B882A0851D1",
      "text": "Riguardo alla maschera che mi hai mostrato...\\nMi sembra che manchi una parte della gemma\\r\\nsulla fronte.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_17",
      "hash64": "A9040A882A08501E",
      "text": "Potrei provare a ripararla. Puoi lasciarmela\\nper un po’?[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_13",
      "hash64": "201C8A556D6C62E3",
      "text": "Forse si è rotta quando è caduta dalle scale?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_14",
      "hash64": "201C8F556D6C6B62",
      "text": "Beh, tanto vale sistemarla per bene prima\\ndi ridarla a Ogerpon![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_system_01",
      "hash64": "73D359AF4019283F",
      "text": "Hai dato la Maschera Turchese al nonno!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_18",
      "hash64": "A90405882A08479F",
      "text": "La tratterò con cura, non preoccuparti.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_15",
      "hash64": "201C90556D6C6D15",
      "text": "Uff... Come vorrei rivedere Ogerpon! Però\\nmi tocca aspettare che la maschera sia pronta.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_16",
      "hash64": "201C8D556D6C67FC",
      "text": "Per oggi mi dedicherò all’orientamento senza\\nfare storie. Non vorrei che Rirì si insospettisse.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_17",
      "hash64": "201C8E556D6C69AF",
      "text": "Ora dovrebbe essere da qualche parte\\nin paese ad ammazzare il tempo.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_sister_18",
      "hash64": "201C93556D6C722E",
      "text": "Il tizio con cui faccio coppia è di un banale\\nche la metà basta.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_0260_gfather_19",
      "hash64": "A90404882A0845EC",
      "text": "Non devi rivelare a nessuno la vera storia.\\c\\nIo nel frattempo preparo tutto il necessario per\\nriparare la maschera dell’orco.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
